# quest/027/StmBdz322_02718 — «Sink or Swim» · in play order
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: イサリ村の少年は、泳ぎの得意な人を探しているようだ。
#. de: Ein ängstlicher Junge aus Isari ist auf der Suche nach einem Mentor.
#. fr: Le jeune garçon d'Isari cherche quelqu'un qui nage bien.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "A young Isari boy seeks a mentor."
msgstr ""

#. ja: イサリ村の少年に「手まねきする」をする
#. de: Den ängstlichen Jungen herbeiwinken (/herbei)
#. fr: Utiliser l'emote <i>/viens</i> devant le jeune garçon d'Isari
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_TODO_00:1"
msgid "/beckon the anxious boy."
msgstr ""

#. ja: イサリ村の少年に「応援する」をする
#. de: Den ängstlichen Jungen anfeuern (/feuer)
#. fr: <i>/encourager</i> le jeune garçon d'Isari
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_TODO_01:1"
msgid "/cheer on the anxious boy."
msgstr ""

#. ja: イサリ村の少年に「祈る」をする
#. de: Für den ängstlichen Jungen beten (/beten)
#. fr: <i>/prier</i> pour le jeune garçon d'Isari
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_TODO_02:1"
msgid "/pray for the anxious boy."
msgstr ""

#. ja: イサリ村の少年に「称賛する」をする
#. de: Dem ängstlichen Jungen deine Anerkennung ausdrücken (/super)
#. fr: <i>/féliciter</i> le jeune garçon d'Isari
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_TODO_03:1"
msgid "/congratulate the anxious boy."
msgstr ""

#. ja: アジロに「アピール」をする
#. de: Ajiro wortlos versichern, dass du seine Angelkiste wiedererlangen wirst (/ich)
#. fr: Utiliser l'emote <i>/moi</i> devant Ajiro
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_TODO_04:1"
msgid "Assure Ajiro you will retrieve his tackle box with a wordless “Leave it to /me.”"
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet EventItem 2002245 0>を入手
#. de: Die Angelkiste finden
#. fr: Récupérer <noun-fr EventItem 2 2002245 1 1>
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_TODO_05:1"
msgid "Obtain the tackle box."
msgstr ""

#. ja: アジロに<sheet EventItem 2002245 0>を渡す
#. de: Die Angelkiste bei Ajiro abliefern
#. fr: Donner <noun-fr EventItem 2 2002245 1 1> à Ajiro
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_TODO_06:1"
msgid "Deliver the tackle box to Ajiro."
msgstr ""

#. ja: イサリ村の少年と話す
#. de: Mit dem ängstlichen Jungen sprechen
#. fr: Parler au jeune garçon d'Isari
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_TODO_07:1"
msgid "Speak with the anxious boy."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ねえ、<if $gn4>おねーちゃん<else>おにーちゃん</if>って、泳ぐの得意？<br>だったら、手伝ってほしいことがあるんだ。
#. de: Äh, Verzeihung, <if $gn4>meine Dame<else>mein Herr</if>? K-Könnt Ihr vielleicht schwimmen? Dann würde ich nämlich Eure Hilfe gebrauchen.
#. fr: Dites, <if $gn4>Madame l'aventurière<else>Monsieur l'aventurier</if>... Vous savez nager, pas vrai<nbsp>? Si vous avez un moment, j'aurais besoin de votre aide...
#. speaker: FISHERSON02718
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>mister</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_FISHERSON02718_000_000:1"
msgid "Um, <if $gn4>miss<else>mister</if>? D-Do you know how to swim? Because if you do, I need your help."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 僕、前は泳ぐの得意で、大好きだったんだよ。<br>でも調子に乗って沖に出て、溺れかけたことがあって、<br>それから海が怖くなっちゃって……。
#. de: Eigentlich war ich mal ein ziemlich guter Schwimmer. Ich habe nichts mehr geliebt, als mich durch das Wasser treiben zu lassen. Aber dann habe ich mich eines Tages zu weit aufs Meer raus gewagt. Dabei wäre ich fast ertrunken, und seitdem war ich zu ängstlich, um auch nur einen Fuß ins Meer zu setzen.
#. fr: Moi aussi, je nageais comme un poisson dans l'eau avant, mais un jour, je me suis trop éloigné du rivage et j'ai failli me noyer... Depuis, j'ai la trouille de tremper ne serait-ce que le petit orteil dans la mer.
#. speaker: FISHERSON02718
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_FISHERSON02718_000_001:1"
msgid "I used to love the feeling of gliding through the waters more than anything. That is, until one day I pushed my luck and went too far from shore. I nearly drowned, and since then, I have been too scared to even dip my toes into the sea."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 漁師の息子なのに、そんなのバレたら友達にバカにされちゃう。<br>お父さんにも内緒で、こっそり練習したいんだ。
#. de: Als Sohn eines Fischers gibt es kaum eine größere Schande, als sich vor dem Wasser zu fürchten. Darum muss ich heimlich trainieren. Niemand darf etwas von der Sache erfahren<nbsp>- besonders mein Vater nicht.
#. fr: En tant que fils de pêcheur, c'est la honte suprême, vous comprenez<nbsp>? C'est pour ça que je n'ai rien dit à personne, surtout pas à mon père... Je dois absolument vaincre ma peur avant qu'il ne remarque quelque chose.
#. speaker: FISHERSON02718
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_FISHERSON02718_000_002:1"
msgid "There is nothing more shameful than being the son of a fisherman and terrified of water. That is why I must train in secret. No one, absolutely no one can find out about this─especially Father."
msgstr ""

#. ja: まずは、沖にある小舟まで泳ぎたいけど、<br>やっぱりひとりじゃ怖くて……。<br>「手まねき」して、僕を勇気づけてほしいんだ。
#. de: Seht Ihr das kleine Boot dort in der Ferne? Ich möchte versuchen, dorthin zu schwimmen, aber ich fürchte, das schaffe ich nicht alleine. Könntet Ihr vielleicht voraus schwimmen und mich ins Wasser herbeiwinken?
#. fr: J'ai essayé de nager jusqu'au petit bateau là-bas, mais rien à faire, je n'y arrive pas tout seul... Vous voulez bien m'inviter à <i>venir</i> dans l'eau, s'il vous plaît<nbsp>?
#. speaker: FISHERSON02718
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_FISHERSON02718_000_003:1"
msgid "Do you see that small boat over there? I want to attempt to swim to it, but I am afraid I cannot do it alone. Please, might you lead the way and <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>beckon</ui-edge-color></ui-color> me into the waters?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: まずは、沖にある小舟まで行きたいけど、<br>やっぱりひとりじゃ怖くて……。<br>「手まねき」して、僕を勇気づけてほしいんだ。
#. de: Ich möchte zu diesem Boot schwimmen, aber das schaffe ich nicht alleine. Jemand muss mich ins Wasser herbeiwinken.
#. fr: J'ai essayé de nager jusqu'au petit bateau là-bas, mais rien à faire, je n'y arrive pas tout seul... Vous voulez bien m'inviter à <i>venir</i> dans l'eau, s'il vous plaît<nbsp>?
#. speaker: FISHERSON02718
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_FISHERSON02718_000_009:1"
msgid "I want to swim to that boat there but I cannot do it alone. I need someone to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>beckon</ui-edge-color></ui-color> me into the waters."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 僕……がんばるよ。<br>でも、もしも僕が恐くなって、<br>海で動けなくなってたら、「応援」してね。
#. de: Ich ... Ich werde langsam einen Fuß vor den anderen setzen<nbsp>... und dann in das<nbsp>... \<schluck> Wasser gehen. Sollte ich starr vor Angst werden, dann müsst Ihr mich anfeuern, damit ich mich überwinden kann.
#. fr: Merci<nbsp>! Je ferai de mon mieux, mais si j'ai du mal, je compte sur vous pour m'<i>encourager</i>, d'accord<nbsp>?
#. speaker: FISHERSON02718
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_FISHERSON02718_000_010:1"
msgid "I...I am going to slowly start moving forward...and into the...\\<gulp>...water. Should I become too petrified to move, I need for you to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>cheer</ui-edge-color></ui-color> me on that I might overcome my fear."
msgstr ""

#. ja: なんとかここまで来たけれど……<br>この先から深いと思うと、怖くて、怖くて……。<br>お願いだから、僕を「応援」して。
#. de: ... Ich k-kann nicht w-weiter. \<schauder> Ich muss umkehren!
#. fr: Et voilà, j-je le savais... J'ai réussi à nager jusqu'ici, mais d-depuis que je n'ai plus pied, je suis tétanisé... Il faut que vous m'<i>encouragiez</i><nbsp>!
#. speaker: FISHERSON02718
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_FISHERSON02718_000_019:1"
msgid "...I c-c-can't go any f-further. \\<shudder> I must turn back!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: あ、ありがとう、落ち着いてきたよ……。<br>先に進んでみるけど、くじけそうになってたら、<br>僕が前に進めるように、「お祈り」してて……約束だよ！
#. de: Da-Danke schön. Mein Herz pocht nicht mehr ganz so schnell. Ich denke, ich schaffe es noch ein bisschen weiter<nbsp>... Es würde helfen, wenn Ihr für mich beten könntet, damit ich sicher dort ankomme.
#. fr: M-merci, je sens que je reprends confiance<nbsp>! Je vais essayer d'avancer maintenant... S'il m'arrive malheur, <i>priez</i> pour moi<nbsp>!
#. speaker: FISHERSON02718
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_FISHERSON02718_000_020:1"
msgid "Th-Thank you. My heart no longer feels as though it is pounding out of my chest. I think I can push myself just a bit further... I may need your <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>prayers</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, however, to guide me along and keep me safe."
msgstr ""

#. ja: うう……<if $gn4>おねーちゃん<else>おにーちゃん</if>、僕、もうだめそうだよ……。<br>お願いだよ……僕が前に進めるように「お祈り」して……
#. de: B-Bitte, <if $gn4>meine Dame<else>mein Herr</if>! Betet für mich. Ich habe solche Angst<nbsp>... solch schreckliche Angst!
#. fr: <if $gn4>Madame l'aventurière<else>Monsieur l'aventurier</if>... Je n'en peux plus... S'il vous plaît, faites une <i>prière</i> pour moi, et que les Dieux vous entendent...
#. speaker: FISHERSON02718
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>mister</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_FISHERSON02718_000_029:1"
msgid "P-Please, <if $gn4>miss<else>mister</if>! <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Pray</ui-edge-color></ui-color> for me. I am so afraid...so terribly afraid!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: よぉぉおし……気力が沸いてきた！<br><if $gn4>おねーちゃん<else>おにーちゃん</if>のおかげで、もうひとふんばりするよ。<br>もし、小舟までいけたら、僕のこと「褒めて」ね！！
#. de: \<seufz> Vielen Dank. Ich wurde plötzlich von einer irrationalen Furcht erfasst, aber Eure Gebete haben mir darüber hinweg geholfen. Ich denke, ich kann es schaffen! Ich werde den Rest des Weges zu dem Boot schwimmen. Ich hoffe, Ihr werdet dort sein, um mir Eure Anerkennung auszudrücken!
#. fr: Oh là là, incroyable<nbsp>! Je me sens frais comme un gardon<nbsp>! Maintenant, c'est sûr, je vais pouvoir nager jusqu'au bateau<nbsp>! J'espère que vous me <i>féliciterez</i>, hé hé<nbsp>!
#. speaker: FISHERSON02718
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_FISHERSON02718_000_030:1"
msgid "\\<sigh> Thank you. I was gripped by an irrational fear, but your prayers have melted it away. I think I can do this! I am going to try swimming the rest of the way to the boat. I hope you will be there, waiting to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>congratulate</ui-edge-color></ui-color> me when I do!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: <if $gn4>おねーちゃん<else>おにーちゃん</if>、ぼくやったよ！！<br>僕のこと「褒めて」くれる？
#. de: Seht nur, <if $gn4>meine Dame<else>mein Herr</if>! Ich habe es geschafft! Ich habe es wirklich geschafft!
#. fr: Ça y est, j'ai réussi<nbsp>! Ça mérite des <i>félicitations</i>, non<nbsp>?
#. speaker: FISHERSON02718
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>mister</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_FISHERSON02718_000_039:1"
msgid "Look, <if $gn4>miss<else>mister</if>! I did it! I actually did it!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: おお、アンタたち、ここまで泳いできたのか？
#. de: Oho! Ihr beide müsst ja wirklich weit geschwommen sein, wenn ihr es bis hierhin geschafft habt!
#. fr: Vous avez nagé jusqu'ici<nbsp>? Vous devez avoir mal partout<nbsp>!
#. speaker: AJIRO
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_AJIRO_000_039:1"
msgid "Oho! The two of you must have swum quite a ways to make it all the way out here!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: えっへん！<br>でも、<if $gn4>おねーちゃん<else>おにーちゃん</if>が、ついてきてくれたおかげだよ！<br>ありがとう！！
#. de: Ich habe es geschafft! Ich kann es kaum glauben! Vielen lieben Dank, <if $gn4>meine Dame<else>mein Herr</if>! Eure Unterstützung hat mich bis hierhin getragen.
#. fr: Ha ha ha<nbsp>! Merci beaucoup<nbsp>! Sans vous, je n'y serais jamais arrivé<nbsp>!
#. speaker: FISHERSON02718
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>mister</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_FISHERSON02718_000_040:1"
msgid "I made it! I can scarce believe it! Oh, thank you so very much, <if $gn4>miss<else>mister</if>! Your encouragement is what kept me afloat and allowed me to come this far."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ボウズ、なかなか泳ぎが達者じゃないか。<br>ゆくゆくは、立派な海の男だな。
#. de: Sag mal, Junge, du bist aber ein ziemlich guter Schwimmer. Du scheinst dich im Meer wie zu Hause zu fühlen.
#. fr: Dis donc, gamin, tu te débrouilles plutôt bien dans la flotte. Voilà un enfant de la mer comme je les aime<nbsp>!
#. speaker: AJIRO
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_AJIRO_000_041:1"
msgid "Say there, boy, you are quite the swimmer. You seem to be right at home in the sea. "
msgstr ""

#. ja: ほんと？<br>僕、父さんみたいな立派な漁師になりたいんだ！
#. de: ... Meint Ihr wirklich? Ich habe immer davon geträumt, in die Fußstapfen meines Vaters zu treten und ein Fischer zu werden. Eure Worte erfüllen mein Herz mit Hoffnung!
#. fr: C-c'est vrai, vous le pensez vraiment<nbsp>? Si je m'entraîne aussi dur, c'est parce qu'un jour, je veux devenir un pêcheur de talent comme mon père<nbsp>!
#. speaker: FISHERSON02718
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_FISHERSON02718_000_042:1"
msgid "...You really think so? I have long dreamed of becoming a great fisherman like my father and your words have filled my heart with hope!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: だったら、漁師は身体が資本だから怪我には気をつけろよ。<br>俺なんて腰を痛めて、<sheet EventItem 2002245 0>を海に落としちまった。<br>取りにもいけないし、治るまで漁もお休みだ。
#. de: Nun, wenn es dir damit ernst ist, dann solltest du gut auf deine Gesundheit aufpassen. Schließlich ist ein Fischer bei schlechter Gesundheit wie ein Fisch auf dem Trockenen. Sieh mich nur an zum Beispiel. Wegen meiner stechenden Rückenschmerzen habe ich eben erst meine Angelkiste ins Wasser fallen lassen.
#. fr: Dans ce cas, fais bien attention à ne pas te blesser. Comme on dit chez nous, un pêcheur en mauvaise santé est comme un poisson dans les filets<nbsp>! D'ailleurs, je commence à me faire vieux et j'ai fait tomber <noun-fr EventItem 3 2002245 1 1> dans l'eau...
#. speaker: AJIRO
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_AJIRO_000_043:1"
msgid "Well, if you are serious about pursuing that dream, I suggest you take care of yourself. After all, a fisherman in poor health at sea is like a floundering fish on land. Take me for example. My back pains flared up earlier and caused me to drop my tackle box into the water."
msgstr ""

#. ja: そんな……僕が、もしも取りに行けるなら、<br>舟に上がって、おじさんに「アピール」するんだけどなぁ。<br>さすがに海の底じゃ、<if $gn4>おねーちゃん<else>おにーちゃん</if>でも無理だよね？
#. de: Wenn ich bis zum Meeresboden tauchen könnte, würde ich liebend gerne den Besitz dieses Mannes wiederholen. Leider übersteigt das meine Fä<shy>hig<shy>kei<shy>ten bei weitem, aber Ihr seid doch bestimmt dazu in der Lage! Wenn Ihr dem Fischer helfen könnt, dann solltet Ihr ihn mal auf Euch aufmerksam machen.
#. fr: Hmm... Si je pouvais plonger aussi pro<shy>fon<shy>dé<shy>ment, j'irais récupérer la caisse de ce brave monsieur, mais... <if $gn4>Madame l'aventurière<else>Monsieur l'aventurier</if><nbsp>! Ne me dites pas que vous en êtes capable<nbsp>!
#. speaker: FISHERSON02718
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_FISHERSON02718_000_043:1"
msgid "If I could dive beneath the waves and make it to the ocean floor, I would gladly retrieve this man's possessions for him. Sadly, it is far beyond my ability. If you think you can do it, however, perhaps you can show him with a wordless “Leave it to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>me</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.”"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 治ったら取りに行くから、心配はいらんよ。<br>道具は痛んじまうが、自業自得だからな。
#. de: Lasst euch beiden das eine Lehre sein. Die Gesundheit kommt stets an erster Stelle. Ich werde mich ein wenig ausruhen und dann versuchen, meine Angelkiste zu bergen.
#. fr: Ne vous tracassez pas pour ma caisse, j'irai la récupérer plus tard<nbsp>! Lorsque mon dos voudra bien cesser de me faire des misères...
#. speaker: AJIRO
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_AJIRO_000_049:1"
msgid "Let this be a lesson to the both of you. You must put your physical well-being first. I am going to take a short rest, then attempt to go and retrieve my possessions."
msgstr ""

#. ja: もしも、僕が釣り具箱を取りに行けるなら、<br>舟に上がって、おじさんに「アピール」するんだけどなぁ……。<br>さすがに海の底じゃ、<if $gn4>おねーちゃん<else>おにーちゃん</if>でも無理だよね？
#. de: Macht den Mann in dem Boot auf Euch aufmerksam und vermittelt ihm so, dass Ihr Euch um die Bergung seiner Angelkiste kümmern werdet.
#. fr: Hmm... Si je pouvais plonger aussi pro<shy>fon<shy>dé<shy>ment, j'irais récupérer la caisse de ce brave monsieur, mais... <if $gn4>Madame l'aventurière<else>Monsieur l'aventurier</if><nbsp>! Ne me dites pas que vous en êtes capable<nbsp>!
#. speaker: FISHERSON02718
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_FISHERSON02718_000_049:1"
msgid "If you think yourself capable, turn to the man on the boat and reassure him that you will retrieve his things for him with a silent “Leave it to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>me</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.”"
msgstr ""

#. ja: お、なんだ、改まって？<br>ずいぶん胸はってるな？
#. de: Oh, du denkst also, du könntest gut genug tauchen, um in den Tiefen des Meeres zu bestehen?
#. fr: Ha ha<nbsp>! Je vois que vous n'avez peur de rien<nbsp>!
#. speaker: AJIRO
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_AJIRO_100_049:1"
msgid "Oh? So you think yourself an adept enough diver to brave the depths of the sea?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: もしかして、<if $gn4>おねーちゃん<else>おにーちゃん</if>、海の底にも行けるの！？<br>おじさんの釣り具箱を取りに行ってくれるってこと？
#. de: <if $gn4>Meine Dame<else>Mein Herr</if>, könnt Ihr tauchen?! Denkt Ihr, Ihr schafft es bis zum Meeresgrund, um die Sachen dieses Mannes zu bergen?
#. fr: Vous êtes sérieu<if $gn4>se<else>x</if><nbsp>? Vous allez vraiment plonger jusqu'au fond<nbsp>?
#. speaker: FISHERSON02718
#. macro: <if $gn4>Miss<else>Mister</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_FISHERSON02718_000_050:1"
msgid "<if $gn4>Miss<else>Mister</if>, you know how to dive!? You think you can make it to the seabed and fetch this man's things?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: おお、そいつは渡りに船だ！<br>海に浸かりっぱなしじゃ傷んじまうからな、頼んだぞ！
#. de: Wenn du das wirklich über<shy>nehmen möchtest, dann sage ich nicht Nein. Aber sei vorsichtig<nbsp>- die Gewässer können ziemlich finster und gefährlich sein.
#. fr: Aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if>, vous me sauvez la mise<nbsp>! J'ai honte de l'admettre, mais je n'ai plus la fougue de mes vertes années...
#. speaker: AJIRO
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_AJIRO_000_050:1"
msgid "If you are truly capable and willing, I shall not refuse the favor. Just be careful─the waters can be a dark and treacherous place."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet EventItem 2002245 0>」を取りに行ってくれるなんて、<br>助かるよ！
#. de: Ich würde es sehr zu schätzen wissen, wenn du meine Angelkiste bergen könntest.
#. fr: Revenez-nous vite avec <noun-fr EventItem 3 2002245 1 1><nbsp>!
#. speaker: AJIRO
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_AJIRO_000_051:1"
msgid "If you could retrieve my tackle, it would be greatly appreciated."
msgstr ""

#. ja: がんばれ、<if $gn4>おねーちゃん<else>おにーちゃん</if>！
#. de: Anscheinend sind unsere Rollen nun vertauscht! Jetzt bin ich an der Reihe, Euch anzufeuern! Ihr schafft es, <if $gn4>meine Dame<else>mein Herr</if>! Ich glaube fest an Euch!
#. fr: À vous l'honneur, <if $gn4>Madame l'aventurière<else>Monsieur l'aventurier</if><nbsp>!
#. speaker: FISHERSON02718
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>mister</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_FISHERSON02718_000_052:1"
msgid "It seems our roles have been reversed! Now it is my turn to cheer you on! You can do it, <if $gn4>miss<else>mister</if>! I know you can!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 俺の釣り具箱は、見つかったかい？
#. de: Konntest du meine Angelkiste finden?
#. fr: Ne me dites pas que vous avez déjà retrouvé <noun-fr EventItem 3 2002245 1 1><nbsp>!?
#. speaker: AJIRO
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_AJIRO_000_070:1"
msgid "Were you able to find my tackle box?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: いやー、助かったよ。<br>感謝しても、しきれねえな。
#. de: Ich muss schon sagen, ich bin beeindruckt! Du hast mir einiges an Ärger erspart.
#. fr: Vous m'enlevez une sacrée épine du pied<nbsp>! Il n'y a pas à dire, les jeunes ont de l'énergie à revendre de nos jours...
#. speaker: AJIRO
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_AJIRO_000_071:1"
msgid "I must say I am impressed! You have saved me a great deal of hassle."
msgstr ""

#. ja: こんなに泳ぎがうまい上に、人格者が師匠ときたら、<br>弟子のボウズの泳ぎが達者なのも、納得ってもんだ。<br>ボウズの将来も期待できるな！
#. de: Mein Junge, mit <if $gn4>einer Mentorin<else>einem Mentor</if> wie <if $gn4>dieser Dame<else>diesem Mann</if> hier wirst du sicherlich eines Tages ein Meister des Meeres werden!
#. fr: Pas étonnant que ce gamin nage aussi bien avec un professeur comme vous, ha ha<nbsp>! Qu'est-ce que ce sera quand il sera devenu adulte<nbsp>!
#. speaker: AJIRO
#. macro: <if $gn4>lady<else>man</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_AJIRO_000_072:1"
msgid "My boy, with a fine mentor like this <if $gn4>lady<else>man</if> here, you are sure to become a master of the seas someday!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: さて、身体も冷えてきただろう。<br>そろそろ、浜辺に戻りな。
#. de: Inzwischen müsste es euch beiden allerdings ein wenig kalt werden, oder? Kehrt lieber schnell zur Küste zurück, bevor ihr euch noch einen Schnupfen einfangt.
#. fr: Aïe<nbsp>! Il ne faut pas que je m'emballe comme ça, mon dos me relance à chaque fois... Il est temps d'aller faire une petite sieste. Merci encore à vous deux<nbsp>!
#. speaker: AJIRO
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_AJIRO_000_073:1"
msgid "Now the two of you must be starting to feel the bitter bite of the waters right about now. You best return to the shore quickly before you succumb to the cold."
msgstr ""

#. ja: よーし、帰りはひとりで泳ぎ切ってみせるね。<br>最初に<if $gn4>おねーちゃん<else>おにーちゃん</if>と会った浜で待ってるよ！
#. de: <if $gn4>Meine Dame<else>Mein Herr</if>, ich werde versuchen, alleine zurückzuschwimmen! Wir sehen uns an der Küste bei dem großen Felsen, wo wir uns getroffen haben!
#. fr: On n'a plus qu'à rentrer aussi, alors<nbsp>! Ne vous en faites pas, je me débrouillerai tout seul sur le chemin du retour. À tout à l'heure<nbsp>!
#. speaker: FISHERSON02718
#. macro: <if $gn4>Miss<else>Mister</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_FISHERSON02718_000_074:1"
msgid "<if $gn4>Miss<else>Mister</if>, I am going to attempt to swim back on my own! I will see you back at the coast near the large boulder where we first met!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 釣り具の件、本当にありがとよ。<br>ボウズにも、よろしくな！
#. de: Pass gut auf diesen Jungen auf, <if $gn4>meine Liebe<else>mein Freund</if>! Er hat eine leuchtende Zukunft vor sich!
#. fr: Prenez bien soin de ce gamin, aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if><nbsp>! Il a de l'avenir<nbsp>!
#. speaker: AJIRO
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_AJIRO_000_079:1"
msgid "Take good care of that boy, my friend! His future is bright!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 待ってたよ！<br><if $gn4>おねーちゃん<else>おにーちゃん</if>の泳ぎ方のマネをしてみたら、<br>スイスイ進んで、帰りは全然怖くなかったよ。
#. de: Oh, da seid Ihr ja! Auf dem Rückweg habe ich versucht, Euren Schwimmstil nachzuahmen. So konnte ich fast wie ein Hai durch das Wasser gleiten! Das war eine befreiende Erfahrung!
#. fr: Il m'a suffi d'imiter votre style de nage pour revenir en moins de deux<nbsp>! En plus, je n'ai pas eu peur une seule seconde<nbsp>!
#. speaker: FISHERSON02718
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_FISHERSON02718_000_080:1"
msgid "Oh, there you are! On the way back, I tried imitating the way you swam and found that I was able to effortlessly glide through the waters! It was a liberating experience!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 父さんより泳ぎが上手な人って、初めて見たよ！<br>村一番の漁師になるために、僕も負けてられないや。<br>ありがとう、<if $gn4>おねーちゃん<else>おにーちゃん</if>！
#. de: Ich hätte nicht gedacht, dass es jemanden gibt, der besser als mein Vater schwimmen kann, aber Ihr übertrefft ihn bei weitem! Vielen Dank, <if $gn4>meine Dame<else>mein Herr</if>! Dank Euch konnte ich meine Angst vor dem Wasser überwinden und bin meinem Traum, der beste Fischer des Dorfes zu werden, einen Schritt näher gekommen.
#. fr: C'est la première fois que je vois quelqu'un nager encore mieux que mon père, et ce n'est pas peu dire. J'espère qu'un jour, j'arriverai à votre niveau<nbsp>! Merci pour tout, <if $gn4>Madame l'aventurière<else>Monsieur l'aventurier</if><nbsp>!
#. speaker: FISHERSON02718
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>mister</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/027/StmBdz322_02718:TEXT_STMBDZ322_02718_FISHERSON02718_000_081:1"
msgid "I did not think there was anyone in the world that could swim better than my father, but you are far, far superior! Thank you, <if $gn4>miss<else>mister</if>─because of you I have overcome my fear and am one step closer to realizing my dream of becoming the village's best fisherman!"
msgstr ""
